category: Libs
requires: libfmt-devel libsemigroups3 pkg-config
sdesc: "C++ library for semigroups and monoids (development)"
ldesc: "libsemigroups is a C++ library for semigroups and monoids; it is partly based
on Algorithms for computing finite semigroups, Expository Slides, and
Semigroupe 2.01 by Jean-Eric Pin."
external-source: libsemigroups

